                                                "sense_id": "09f5c6c0-3b66-33ad-9fad-ffa1ac6f3a40",
                                                "text": "“Relay that!” Thwaite shouted. Somewhere on the bridge a hand closed over a relay and dropped the AIDs into an electronic catatonia."
